            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Questions from patients about analgesic pharmacotherapy and responses from authors are presented to help educate patients and make them more effective self-advocates. The topic addressed in this issue is interstitial cystitis and a discussion on pathology, genetics, course of disease, symptoms, and treatments.</AbstractText>
